      "side": 1,
      "message": "Isn\u0027t that \"conservative\" approach what we get when using the oldest stubs, before this CL? With the newest stubs I reckon we instead end up with potentially superfluous __builtin_available guards in APEX-to-APEX calls? (Of course, those guards may still be traded for dlopen/dlsym-style access.)",
